              "Internal Rate of Return (IRR): The discount rate at which NPV equals zero; must exceed the bank's lending cost of capital.",
              "Debt Service Coverage Ratio (DSCR): (Net Profit + Depreciation + Interest) / (Interest + Principal Repayment); ideal ratio is 1.5 to 2.0.",
