        "Step 4: Cash accrual computation (adding back depreciation and interest)",
        "Step 5: Total debt commitment (\u20b918,00,000) and resultant DSCR calculation (0.39)",
        "Managerial recommendations: Bank principal moratorium, capacity expansion to 95%, and price adjustment"
